@startuml
title FR-20 - Decide Hospital Request - Activity Diagram

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam conditionStyle InsideDiamond

|Hospital Staff|
start
:Enter request data;

|Client|
:Display the matched bank and\nSubmit and Retry buttons\nunder FR-18 / FR-19;

|Hospital Staff|
while (Retry selected\nbefore submission?) is (Yes)
  :Click the retry button;

  |Server — Inventory|
  :Reevaluate the match under FR-19;

  |Client|
  :Display the updated result and\napplicable buttons under FR-19;

  |Hospital Staff|
endwhile (No)

if (A matched bank is displayed?) then (Yes)
  |Hospital Staff|
  :Click the submit button;

  |Server — Requests|
  :Complete submission under FR-18:\nsave the Pending request and expose\nits notification to bank inventory staff;
else (No)
  stop
endif

|Inventory Staff|
:Open the request notification;

|Server — Requests|
:Retrieve the request and similar Pending\nrequests at the same bank;

|Client|
:Display the request details and\nany similar simultaneous requests;

|Inventory Staff|
if (Similar requests are displayed?) then (Yes)
  :Choose the request to decide;
endif

:Review the selected pending request;

if (Accept is selected?) then (Yes)
  :Click the accept button;
else (No)
  :Click the reject button;
endif

|Server — Requests and Inventory|
:Begin one atomic decision and\nread the current request state;

if (The request state has changed\nor it is no longer Pending?) then (Yes)
  :Flag a concurrent decision conflict;

else (No)
  if (Reject was selected?) then (Yes)
    :Stage rejection without\nreserving any units;

  else (No)
    :Check the current eligible exact-match units\nat the request's addressed bank;

    if (The full quantity is available?) then (Yes)
      :Stage acceptance and reserve the full\nquantity as specific units within\nthis atomic decision;

      :Read similar Pending requests at this bank\nwith the same component, ABO/Rh and quantity;

      :Determine the remaining eligible quantity\nafter this reservation;

      while (Another similar Pending request?) is (Yes)
        if (The remaining quantity can\nfully satisfy this request?) then (Yes)
          :Keep it Pending without\nreserving any units;
        else (No)
          :Stage automatic rejection for\ninsufficient stock without a reservation;
        endif
      endwhile (No)

    else (No)
      :Stage rejection of the selected request\nfor insufficient stock without\na partial reservation;
    endif
  endif
endif

:Commit all decision changes together\nonly if the request state and unit\nallocations remain valid;

if (A concurrent conflict was detected?) then (Yes)
  :Roll back this attempted decision;\nno new acceptance or partial reservation;

  :Reevaluate current request states\nand current eligible matching stock;
endif

|Server — Requests|
:Make the saved current request statuses\navailable to hospital staff;

|Client|
:Display the decision or the reevaluated\ncurrent result to inventory staff;

stop
@enduml